  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n`<map>`/`<area>` coordinate origin is defined as the \"top left edge of the image\".\n\nI'm not sure what \"edge of the image\" actually means here. I haven't been able to find a definition.\n\nTesting hasn't clarified this either: in this demo, Chrome and Firefox behave differently: https://codepen.io/sb3nder/full/JoWeqoQ\n\nI stumbled upon this while considering writing a WPT ref test suite for `<area>`.",
